# The Rust browser host this tree builds (ADR-0278 SD5, proposed): the output
# of rust/imzero2/build_rust_browser.sh under the pinned toolchain, which is
# byte-identical wherever it is built. A tab binary's `bundle` fetches the
# host by this digest when bundling from another module; the tab-host workflow
# builds the tree, fails when its digest differs from this one, and publishes
# it under the digest. After a change to the browser host's sources, refresh
# both lines with:
#
#   go run ./public/thestack/cmd/imzero2tab hostdigest --write
sha256 3fcae02e7ea1b5788a2159c3d4b6026223e47a0b64ec23b543a02fb247c5ff2b
idl bc2a2f7150487548
